      <div class="menu-foot rv">
        <p>All prices in Malaysian Ringgit (RM), not subject to SST. À la carte from 1 box; served buffet from 35 pax; drop-off has no minimum.</p>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}?text=Hi%20Dateen%21%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20your%20Bento%20Menu." class="btn btn-red">WhatsApp Us
